'''Fisher''' (Japanese: '''釣り人''' ''Fisherman'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Wisdom of Sea and Sky}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=Flip 3 coins. For each heads, a {{e|Water}} Pokémon is chosen at random from your discard pile and put into your hand.
}}

