==Trivia==
* {{TCG|Fisherman}} is also a card in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but has a different effect.
** That card uses the English name "Fisherman" as the Trainer Class was known as prior to [[Generation VIII]], but shares the Japanese name 釣り人  ''Tsuribito''.

===Origin===
The {{tc|Fisher}} Trainer class is a type of [[Pokémon Trainer]] in the [[Pokémon games]]. This card's artwork features the Fisher's appearance from the [[Generation IV]] games.

